{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/spectralLayout(weight:maxIterations:)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing","doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A drawing whose axes are eigenvectors of the Laplacian: x is the eigenvector of the second","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"smallest eigenvalue of L = D − A (the Fiedler vector of a connected graph) and y that of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the third, both of unit length, in ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/graphprotocols\/graph\/spectrallayout(weight:maxiterations:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"spectralLayout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIterations","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":"?) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NoConvergence","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols13NoConvergenceV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Drawing","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"GraphDrawing","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"title":"spectralLayout(weight:maxIterations:)","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/GraphDrawing\/SpectralLayout.swift#L30","fileName":"SpectralLayout.swift"},"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P0A7DrawingE14spectralLayout6weight13maxIterationsAD0C0Vy6VertexQzGSd5Edges_5IndexQZXE_SiSgtAA13NoConvergenceVYKF","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"spectralLayout"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"weight"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","text":"Edges","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","text":"Index"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":" = { _ in 1 }, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"maxIterations"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols13NoConvergenceV","text":"NoConvergence","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/NoConvergence"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V","text":"Drawing","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/Drawing"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A is the weighted adjacency matrix: parallel edges add their weights, self-loops are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ignored, and a weight of 0 is no edge. The eigenvalues are sorted ascending with their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"multiplicity, so a graph with c components has c zero eigenvalues and its axes come from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"eigenvectors of 0 when c > 1 (which ones is fixed by the solver, not specified). Each axis’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sign makes its first entry, in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"text":" order, whose magnitude is at least 10⁻⁴ of its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"largest positive. Two vertices have y = 0, and one vertex is at the origin. The drawing is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not rescaled (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rescaled(scale:center:)"},{"text":" maps it to a common frame). A directed graph is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"drawn through ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"undirectedView"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dense: Householder tridiagonalization and the implicit QL iteration, O(n³) time and n²"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"Double","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"s, for graphs of up to a few thousand vertices."}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Koren, “Drawing graphs by eigenvectors: theory and practice”, Computers & Mathematics with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Applications 49(11–12), 2005.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Precondition","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every weight is finite and not negative; ","type":"text"},{"code":"maxIterations","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", when given, is at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"least 1.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Throws","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NoConvergence"},{"type":"text","text":" after "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIterations"},{"type":"text","text":" QL iterations in all (30 n when nil), with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that count and the off-diagonal entry being reduced, relative to the largest entry of its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"block. The iteration converges cubically, about two iterations per eigenvalue."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://GraphDrawing/documentation/GraphDrawing/GraphProtocols/Graph/spectralLayout(weight:maxIterations:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A drawing whose axes are eigenvectors of the Laplacian: x is the eigenvector of the second"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"smallest eigenvalue of L = D − A (the Fiedler vector of a connected graph) and y that of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the third, both of unit length, in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"spectralLayout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIterations","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols13NoConvergenceV","text":"NoConvergence","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V","text":"Drawing","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/graphprotocols\/graph\/spectrallayout(weight:maxiterations:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/spectralLayout(weight:maxIterations:)","title":"spectralLayout(weight:maxIterations:)"},"doc://GraphDrawing/documentation/GraphDrawing/GraphProtocols":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"GraphProtocols","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols","role":"collection","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/graphprotocols"},"doc://GraphDrawing/documentation/GraphDrawing/Drawing":{"identifi